//  NFL   L 22.6 = 2023-25 points per team-game [S, nflverse] · hfa 1.75 = 2018-25 home margin 1.75 and average
//        closing spread 1.78 [S, nflverse 2,181 games] · margin SD 12.8 = SD of (result - closing spread) 2018-25 [S]
//        · total SD 13.2 = SD of (total - closing total) 2018-25 [S]
