//  NHL   L 3.08 = 2025-26 league goals per team per game [S] (3.01-3.14 over the last five seasons) · league save % .896-.903
//        [S], league GAA 2.81-2.91 [S] · hfa 0.20 [A, set so a league-average game gives the home side ≈ 53.4% incl. OT/SO]
//  Soccer L 1.40 [A] · hfa 0.30 [A] (2024-25 Premier League was an outlier at ≈ 0.1)
//  CFB   L 29 [A] · hfa 2.8 [A] · margin SD 15.3 [S] · total SD 15.5 [A]
//  WNBA  L 82 [A] · hfa 1.5 [A] · SDs [A]   CBBW L 67 [A] · hfa 3.0 [A] · SDs [A]  (the live league average from standings replaces L)
//  CBB   L 73.5 [A] · hfa 2.8 = KenPom recent home-court value 2.78 [S] · margin SD 11 [S] · total SD 14.5 [A]
//  Added tabs (Baseball+, Hoops+, Football+, Hockey+, AFL, Rugby, Rugby League, Lacrosse, Field Hockey, Volleyball,
//  Water Polo): L and hfa [A] long-run values, margin / total SDs [J]; each league's standings average replaces L.
//  Volleyball is scored in sets won (best of five), so its "score" is sets and its spreads / totals are in sets.
//  Golf and racing are fields, not two-sided games: leaderboards only, nothing is simulated.
// Normal-family dispersion: home/away score SD s0 and correlation c0 follow from the margin and total SDs.
for (const P of Object.values(LEAGUE)) {
  if (P.fam === "norm") { P.s0 = Math.sqrt((P.sdM ** 2 + P.sdT ** 2) / 4); P.c0 = (P.sdT ** 2 - P.sdM ** 2) / (P.sdT ** 2 + P.sdM ** 2); }
}

// ─── SEASON HISTORY: every season on record, not just last year ──────────────
// A team's true level is estimated from ALL of its past seasons with a Kalman filter: a part that carries over
// from year to year (rho) plus a slow franchise level that fades over decades (HIST_FADE). Each season counts
// by the games in it, so a 60-game 2020 or a 1901 season counts for exactly what it is, and old seasons fade out
// on their own instead of being cut off. This season's numbers then update that prior, game by game.
// Baked in, no API cost: MLB 1901-2025 from the Lahman Baseball Database (CC BY-SA 3.0, seanlahman.com) and
// NFL 1999-2025 from nflverse/nfldata (CC BY 4.0). Each season = runs/points scored and allowed per game over that
// season's league average (x1000). Other sports, and any season newer than the table, use the seasons the live
// history route returns (built by the data job), also kept on this device so it works offline.
// HIST_PARAMS [S]: fitted by maximum likelihood on MLB 1969-2025 and NFL 1999-2025 team-seasons. Tested on seasons
// the fit never saw (MLB 2005-25, NFL 2013-25): versus last-season-only, prediction error fell 6% (MLB offense),
// 3% (MLB defense), 4% (NFL offense); NFL defense was even. Sports without a fit use k/rho from LEAGUE (fL 0).
const HIST_FADE = 0.97;                                     // [J, tested 1.00/.97/.95/.90 on MLB; .97 best overall]
