// ─── APP ROOT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// ─── BET SLIPS: everyone's slips, graded from the final score, ranked by record and by money ───────────────────
// Who you are comes from the site login (Cloudflare Access); slips live on the server (functions/api), so they follow
